        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Nintendo-Switch-2-Amazon.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>A Q&A between shareholders and Nintendo's president Shuntaro Furukawa has been released alongside February's quarterly financial report, in which the topic of rising memory costs was discussed. While the price hikes haven't impacted the <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/platforms/switch-2\">Switch 2</a> yet, Furukawa states that might change if the trend continues into the next fiscal year.\n</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/memory-price-rises-have-not-impacted-the-switch-2-yet-says-nintendo-president\">Read more</a></p>",
